@startuml usecase
' MEDIS — Use Case Diagram (actor access derived from DashboardFrame role tabs)
left to right direction
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title MEDIS — Use Case Diagram

actor Admin
actor Receptionist
actor Doctor

rectangle "MEDIS — Hospital Management System" {
  usecase UC0  as "Login"
  usecase UC1  as "Manage Patients\n(add / update / view)"
  usecase UC2  as "Manage Appointments\n(book / cancel / view)"
  usecase UC3  as "Manage Doctors\n(add / view)"
  usecase UC4  as "Generate Reports"
  usecase UC2b as "Prevent Duplicate Slot"
  usecase UC0b as "Validate Credentials"
}

' Every actor authenticates
Admin        --> UC0
Receptionist --> UC0
Doctor       --> UC0
UC0 ..> UC0b : <<include>>

' Patients & Appointments: all three roles (per role tabs)
Admin        --> UC1
Receptionist --> UC1
Doctor       --> UC1

Admin        --> UC2
Receptionist --> UC2
Doctor       --> UC2
UC2 ..> UC2b : <<include>>

' Admin-only capabilities
Admin --> UC3
Admin --> UC4

@enduml
